  "hudSkillKinds": "<em>Auras</em>: slots 1–3, one active, switch with the hotkeys — also mid-fight. <em>Passives</em>: always on, all in parallel. <em>Cooldowns</em> (Q, R, F): fire once, then recharge — the cooldown belongs to the skill, not the slot. Besides your skills, everyone always has two utility buttons, free and unlevelled: <em>Recall</em> takes you back to your bound campfire, and <em>Camp</em> puts down a small fire that heals everyone standing in it for a short while. Both cast slowly and break if you move or get hit. Camp costs a charge — resting at a real campfire refills them, and you carry more of them as you level.",
  "@hudSkillKinds": {
    "description": "HUD help panel (\"How Aura works\"), section \"The three kinds of skills\". <em> marks a term in emphasis; keep the tags around the translated terms (Auren, Passive, Abklingfähigkeiten, Rückkehr, Lager)."
  },
